       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\n- **Drug and dose:** amlodipine 20 mg by mouth, once daily.\n- **Note on the order:** the dose is above the labeled maximum of 10 mg/day, and you reviewed it and confirmed it was intentional. The note also asks staff to monitor BP, HR, and peripheral edema.\n\nPharmacy or nursing may call you to verify the dose, since it's above the usual maximum. I'd watch for hypotension, edema, and reflex tachycardia."
